  "limitations": [
    {
      "id": "L01",
      "text": "B4.43 formal producer FAIL at top-level import; all10 formal cases unexecuted, independent FAIL_INCOMPLETE8 metadata/0 case audits/0RN proofs.94 regression tests are not formal acceptance.",
      "scope": "PUBLIC_OR_STATIC_ONLY_NO_REAL_CERTIFICATION"
    },
    {
      "id": "L02",
      "text": "Actual formal sys.path and sys.executable were not recorded; detailed import-resolution cause remains UNKNOWN_NOT_DIAGNOSED. A static launcher review is not a recreated runtime.",
      "scope": "PUBLIC_OR_STATIC_ONLY_NO_REAL_CERTIFICATION"
    },
    {
      "id": "L03",
      "text": "B4.43 prerequisite131/109 document predicates address B4.42 coverage without clearing its historical FAIL196/195 PASS/1 FAIL/incomplete or independent179 PASS.",
      "scope": "PUBLIC_OR_STATIC_ONLY_NO_REAL_CERTIFICATION"
    },
    {
      "id": "L04",
      "text": "Ten authored contribution systems, at most64 nodes/2 DOFs/3 contributions, do not implement actual mesh, material, quadrature, scatter or load construction.",
      "scope": "PUBLIC_OR_STATIC_ONLY_NO_REAL_CERTIFICATION"
    },
    {
      "id": "L05",
      "text": "Accepted binary64 words are exact intended real identities; decimal spelling, casts and SAME free-space identities cannot be substituted silently.",
      "scope": "PUBLIC_OR_STATIC_ONLY_NO_REAL_CERTIFICATION"
    },
    {
      "id": "L06",
      "text": "Natural intended intervals can overestimate correlated expressions; fixed80-bit sqrt grid has absolute resolution, not relative precision or a real-mesh accuracy promise.",
      "scope": "PUBLIC_OR_STATIC_ONLY_NO_REAL_CERTIFICATION"
    },
    {
      "id": "L07",
      "text": "Max-endpoint squared norm sums are conservative upper enclosures, not exact irrational norm squares or tight spectral estimates.",
      "scope": "PUBLIC_OR_STATIC_ONLY_NO_REAL_CERTIFICATION"
    },
    {
      "id": "L08",
      "text": "Intended interval FIRST and scalar RN-even SECOND are one fixed public DAG; FMA, BLAS, sparse conversions and alternate accumulation are distinct uncertified programs.",
      "scope": "PUBLIC_OR_STATIC_ONLY_NO_REAL_CERTIFICATION"
    },
    {
      "id": "L09",
      "text": "G, K and f are independent authored lists; neither actual assembled G/K nor intended element PSD follows from Gram(A_hat).",
      "scope": "PUBLIC_OR_STATIC_ONLY_NO_REAL_CERTIFICATION"
    },
    {
      "id": "L10",
      "text": "Actual G/K retain both triangles and exact symmetry defects; a symmetric intended operator does not certify symmetric represented arrays.",
      "scope": "PUBLIC_OR_STATIC_ONLY_NO_REAL_CERTIFICATION"
    },
    {
      "id": "L11",
      "text": "beta_G, beta_K, beta_f, beta_eval, q_hat and u_plus are separate mandatory errors/norms. Rounded residual zero never removes operator, load or evaluation error.",
      "scope": "PUBLIC_OR_STATIC_ONLY_NO_REAL_CERTIFICATION"
    },
    {
      "id": "L12",
      "text": "Exact represented-array r_arrays differs from rounded r_hat; Fraction arithmetic establishes public represented identities only, not real sparse execution cost.",
      "scope": "PUBLIC_OR_STATIC_ONLY_NO_REAL_CERTIFICATION"
    },
    {
      "id": "L13",
      "text": "Direct intended residual enclosure and fixed triangle transfer stay separate. Outcome-based bound selection, averaging, shifting and clipping are forbidden.",
      "scope": "PUBLIC_OR_STATIC_ONLY_NO_REAL_CERTIFICATION"
    },
    {
      "id": "L14",
      "text": "Nonfinite, subnormal, nonzero-to-zero, inconclusive sign and outward-range stops retain prefixes. They neither certify singularity nor authorize a fallback.",
      "scope": "PUBLIC_OR_STATIC_ONLY_NO_REAL_CERTIFICATION"
    },
    {
      "id": "L15",
      "text": "Accepted u bits are supplied, not a proved real equilibrium solve, support elimination or accurate intended anchor.",
      "scope": "PUBLIC_OR_STATIC_ONLY_NO_REAL_CERTIFICATION"
    },
    {
      "id": "L16",
      "text": "Residual upper bounds supply no element PSD, left inverse Y, positive coercivity or full-Q storage certificate; all real values remain UNKNOWN_STOP/UNFROZEN.",
      "scope": "PUBLIC_OR_STATIC_ONLY_NO_REAL_CERTIFICATION"
    },
    {
      "id": "L17",
      "text": "Tiny nonzero residual never certifies unmodified U. Diagnostic correction cannot replace original loss, gradient, intercept or SAME stored normalizer.",
      "scope": "PUBLIC_OR_STATIC_ONLY_NO_REAL_CERTIFICATION"
    },
    {
      "id": "L18",
      "text": "Software RSS/timings/CI do not prove historical gaps, real certification cost, full-fit4GiB feasibility or scientific repair. Paid history and all seals remain.",
      "scope": "PUBLIC_OR_STATIC_ONLY_NO_REAL_CERTIFICATION"
